---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What data node-opcua.github.io collects and how we handle it."
>
  <section class="privacy-content">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Google Analytics to measure traffic. We
      collect anonymous, aggregated data: page views, approximate
      geographic location (country and region, derived from a
      truncated IP address), referring site, and device type.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do NOT collect</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect personal profiles, we do not track you
      across other websites, we do not use the data for
      advertising, and we do not share it with third parties
      beyond Google's role as our analytics processor. Google
      Signals and ad personalization are disabled.
    </p>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>
      Analytics run only if you accept them via the banner shown
      on your first visit. If you decline, no analytics cookies
      are set and no analytics data is collected. You can change
      your choice by clearing this site's cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      Analytics data is retained for the minimum period configured
      in Google Analytics (2 months for event-level data).
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the GDPR you have the right to access, rectify, or
      erase your personal data, and to object to its processing.
      For any request, contact Sterfive at contact@sterfive.com.
    </p>

    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      Sterfive SAS, France. Contact: contact@sterfive.com
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-section, 4.5rem) 1.5rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
</style>
